  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment Program for the Energy Transition of the Bolivian Northern Amazon</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Inversiones para la Transicin Energtica del Norte Amaznico Boliviano</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la descarbonizacin del NAB al disminuir las emisiones de GEI, y a la mejora de la sostenibilidad del servicio de energa elctrica. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) reducir el uso de disel para la generacin de electricidad; (ii) mejorar la calidad y eficiencia del suministro de energa; y (iii) incrementar la generacin de electricidad mediante ER.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to contribute to the decarbonization of the NAB by reducing GHG emissions and improving the sustainability of the electric power service. The specific objectives are: (i) to reduce the use of diesel for electricity generation; (ii) to improve the quality and efficiency of the energy supply; and (iii) to increase the generation of electricity through RE.</narrative>
  </description>
